    win the Duel. Once per turn: You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; add
    1 "Ghostrick" Spell/Trap Card from your Deck to your hand. Once per turn: You
    can attach 1 "Ghostrick" card from your hand to this card as an Xyz Material.'
